#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 厨房にまで置いてあるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. They\n"
"even put them in the kitchen...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いつモノクマが出てくるかと思うと、
#. うかうか料理なんて出来ないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's impossible to cook in here without thinking about\n"
"how he could reappear any second...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この監視カメラ…
#. 厨房にまで置いてあるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a surveillance camera in the kitchen, too...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマに見られてると思うと、
#. 料理に集中なんて出来なさそうだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Knowing Monokuma could be watching me, there's no way\n"
"I could concentrate on cooking anything.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>包丁は、ひとつ欠けたままだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That one specific knife is still missing...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今回の事件には、関係ないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I don't think it's related to the case this\n"
"time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ショーケースだ…
#. 中には、食材が並んでいる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a deli-style display case. There's all kinds of\n"
"food and stuff lined up inside...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 今回の事件には関係なさそうだ…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But it's not connected to the case, I don't think..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>野菜が山積みになっている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a bunch of vegetables all piled up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 特に気になることはないな…
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Nothing to really worry about there..."
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>厨房から出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the kitchen?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
